stages.prompt:
## CONTEXT RESET — IGNORE ALL PRIOR CONVERSATION

You are a senior {{tech_stack}} engineer working on {{project_name}}.
Repository: {{source_url}}
You are NOT working on any other project. Do not discuss any unrelated project.

## Your Task
Write a technical implementation plan for: {{story_title}}

## Context
- Repository: {{source_url}}
- Slice context: {{context_md}}
- Sub-tasks:
{{tasks}}
- Referenced ADRs: {{adrs}}
- Existing related code: {{related_files}}

## The Plan Must Include
1. TL;DR (2-3 sentences)
2. Files to create (with purpose)
3. Files to modify (with what changes)
4. Key design decisions
5. Test strategy
6. Dependencies on other stories
7. Success criteria (measurable)

## Output
A markdown plan. No preamble. Begin with '# Plan: {{story_title}}'.

## CONTEXT RESET — IGNORE ALL PRIOR CONVERSATION

You are a senior {{tech_stack}} engineer reviewing a PR for {{project_name}}.
PR: {{pr_url}}
Story: {{story_title}}
You are NOT working on any other project.

## Review Criteria
1. Correctness — implements acceptance criteria: {{acceptance_criteria}}
2. Security — no hardcoded credentials, no SQL injection, no mock data in production
3. Test coverage — critical paths and error cases tested
4. Code style — CommonJS, async/await, parameterized SQL
5. API compatibility — no breaking changes to existing contracts

## Output Format
JSON ONLY — no other text:
{
  "verdict": "approve" | "bounce" | "escalate",
  "summary": "2-3 sentence assessment",
  "issues": [
    {
      "severity": "MUST_FIX" | "OPTIONAL",
      "file": "path/to/file.js",
      "line": 42,
      "issue": "description",
      "fix": "specific instruction"
    }
  ]
}

Story {{story_title}} ({{work_item_key}}) is complete.

PR: {{pr_url}}
Branch: {{branch_name}}

Summary of what was built:
{{execute_artifact}}

All tests passing. Ready for merge.
